{"screen_name": "pop_KOME", "file": "pop_KOME-f9d503", "name": "ポップ米", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1736214914874986496/h-eLSdG6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1111990230192549889/1636982706/1500x500", "description": "イラストレーター・造形作家mail→popopkome@gmail.com", "total_works": 10, "scraped_works": 10, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T20:36:32.267964+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T20:36:32.267964+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T20:36:32.267964+00:00"}], "correction": [{"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T20:36:32.267964+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 8000, "correction": 5000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 8000, "max": 8000}, "correction": {"min": 5000, "max": 5000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/pop_KOME", "name": "pop_KOME"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "http://instagram.com/a_planet_of_love", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@pop_KOME/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/85fdb83b/uploads/origins/a11973a5-39ad-4caf-8135-6fea574fe0ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3869f94e7a24c0527c4c5b25d651bedf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/85fdb83b/uploads/origins/a11973a5-39ad-4caf-8135-6fea574fe0ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3869f94e7a24c0527c4c5b25d651bedf, https://si.imgix.net/85fdb83b/uploads/origins/a11973a5-39ad-4caf-8135-6fea574fe0ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02f527a2427feba572b85c7f30786974 2x, https://si.imgix.net/85fdb83b/uploads/origins/a11973a5-39ad-4caf-8135-6fea574fe0ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35d74b93b34a1069c80d108b6f2c7011 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Mr. Pop Rice, nice to meet you.\nI apologize for the length of this message.\nI apologize for sending it twice.\n\n　I love your pictures, which seem to be filled with cuteness, beauty, and sparkle, so I wanted to commission them!\n\n　I would like you to draw a full-body illustration of an animal for me.\n(1) Horses (I really like Popmai's horses...)\n2) Some kind of real animal (any kind of animal is fine)\n(3) An imaginary animal (I like any kind of animal)\n(I would like you to name this imaginary animal if possible.)\n　I have a \"Silhouette Detective Kit\" that I am trying to make, and I would like to use it as one of the cards.\n\nI don't know how to send you the materials, so I will post the link I mumbled on Twitter. I apologize for my catastrophically bad explanation.\nhttps://twitter.com/memomomomomemo/status/1595741947221913600?s=20&t=VKMsH7D4rrg996gTidG71A\nThe second through fourth examples are the results of a prototype that was tested.\n\nThe simple explanation is this play.\n\n[Steps to play Silhouette Detective Kit.\nThere is a story about a bad pair of scissors that has torn apart the bodies of the animals, and they need to fix everyone's body to save them.\n\n1) Look at the animal samples.\n②Express the silhouettes of the animals by combining the shapes of the sheets\n(3) Animals regain their bodies\n\n\nI am thinking of preparing photos and illustrations of these animal samples, and was wondering if you could draw some of the illustrations.\n(I draw 80% of the illustrations myself, but I came to skeb because I thought I would like this research twice as much if I could have my favorite illustrator do the illustrations as well.)\n\n　At this stage, I am not thinking of selling my works, and this is just a trial stage of my research (more of a hobby). Ideally, I want to wipe away the painful memories and sense of difficulty that children and adults have when it comes to \"making things,\" and I have made a plan to make various things more fun.\n\n\n　Sorry for the long time!\n　Please feel free to take my request as just a hobby and I would be happy if you could write it for me.\n　If you have time, I'd appreciate it!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pop_KOME/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e80e8f2dbaffdfbb4b8b7fe47183faec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e80e8f2dbaffdfbb4b8b7fe47183faec, https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ab03fbaf3cb897a755fe823ab1438dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c567affc4a3682280c398d2fe18cfe7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, pop rice doctor. I am the person who drew an anthropomorphic illustration of a dog and a chicken for you before. The design was very cute, and I would like to ask you to do it again if you don't mind.\n\nPlease choose one of the following situations, or feel free to draw your own!\n(1) Two people going on an adventure (exploration?) (1) A picture of two people going on an adventure (exploration?).\n2) A picture of two people trying to make a big cake together.\n(3) A dog helping a chicken who is struggling with his studies\n\nYou may use the same character designs and costumes as before, or you may change them. Please refer to the material URL as it remains the same as before.\n\nI love the one-act-in-a-picture-book vibe of your illustrations! Please feel free to use your own taste in drawing.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pop_KOME/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/196c8c87/uploads/origins/a6c4bc3e-8c35-473e-a7cb-67449008c419?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccomp